management.3 Therefore, unquestioningly, the largest contributor to anthropogenic nitrogen sources is from the use of the Haber−Bosch process where
$$
\mathrm{N}_{2}+3\mathrm{H}_{2}\rightarrow2\mathrm{NH}_{3}
